#
# Remote instances
#

RemoteInstances                   = Remote instances
RemoteInstancesDescription        = DigiBoard reads tickets and dashboards from other Dolibarr instances via their REST API. Each instance calculates its own indicators: the ReedCRM module must be installed on it, and the token must belong to a user with read permissions on ReedCRM and tickets.
RemoteInstance                    = Remote instance
RemoteInstanceUrl                 = Instance URL
RemoteInstanceUrlDescription      = Root URL of the Dolibarr instance, without trailing slash, for example https://crm.example.com/htdocs. The API is called on this root followed by /api/index.php.
RemoteInstanceToken               = API token (DOLAPIKEY)
RemoteInstanceTokenDescription    = API token of the user on whose behalf data is read. It is stored encrypted and is never redisplayed.
RemoteInstanceTokenKept           = Saved token, leave empty to keep it
RemoteInstanceLocalUrl            = Allow local address
RemoteInstanceLocalUrlDescription = Check only if the instance is on the same network (localhost, 192.168.x.x): otherwise the call will be rejected.
